{"record_id": "entry-1624", "entry_number": 1624, "assignment_position": 195, "frozen_commit": "0089ae722b39edb5180b2496b1f35e2f8fe1ca92", "proposal_status": "supported_partial", "title": "AP Tracker Page Did Not Provide Dated Promise Statuses for March 4, 2026", "description_medium": "The AP project tracks selected promises made during Donald Trump’s campaign and reports progress on individual commitments. A dated status for a specific pledge is needed to assess how easily its record could be audited.", "description_long": "The Associated Press’s campaign-promise tracker follows selected commitments made by Donald Trump and reports their progress individually. A dated status for a named pledge lets readers compare the campaign promise with the reported implementation at that time. The project’s design is to follow selected promises; assessing auditability on a particular date depends on the dated rows and status definitions available then.", "corrected_wording": {"title": "AP Tracker Page Did Not Provide Dated Promise Statuses for March 4, 2026", "original_title": "Trump's Promise Record Remained Easy to Audit Through AP's Persistent Dashboard", "reason": "Limits the entry to the AP project’s existence because the dated dashboard statuses and named pledge are unavailable."}, "source_urls": ["https://apnews.com/projects/trump-campaign-promise-tracker/"], "reference_paths": ["data/neon-workbench/external/description-completion/2026-09-30/lightsprint/input.jsonl", "data/neon-workbench/external/description-completion/2026-09-30/finish-2026-10-01/worker-02-repair-input.jsonl"], "source_access_notes": ["The AP tracker landing page exposed no dated pledge rows or status snapshot."], "blockers": ["The linked AP page contains no dated March 4 snapshot or pledge-level statuses. The record identifies no specific pledge or public completion claim against which the dashboard could be checked."], "rationale": "The tracker landing page exposes the project but not the dated pledge